{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find target. If visible, approach and grab it. Move to destination. Else, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForTarget    /> <Action ID = GrabTarget    /> <Action ID = ApproachTarget    /> <Action ID = MoveTargetToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = GrabTarget    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetHeavy    />\"",
